  "description": "Made from super-light, super-stiff, high modulus carbon fibre, the Leggero is a balance of light and fast. Featuring wind-slicing, droplet-shaped tubes and our finest nano carbon technology, the Leggero provides a responsive ride that jumps the second you drive power through the pedals. Developed with riders from our former pro team, JLT Condor (also known as Rapha Condor team). Countless hours of feedback and testing have continually helped the Leggero evolve and it riders at the front of the peloton. The updated design is speedier than its predecessor with improved aerodynamic efficiency. The frameset features oversized square stays, for increased power transfer and stiffness, the Leggero will be at home on a group ride, tackling climbs or sprinting for the finish line under a rider as powerful as Ed Clancy. Our carbon is proven through everything from one-day classic race to long, gruelling stage races.Kamm-tail aero seat tubeThe Kamm-tail tube creates an improved aerodynamic flow, saving precious rider watts. The trailing edge of a tear-drop shape is sliced off at an optimal point, leaving a profile as aerodynamic as a tear-drop but with a weight saving from removing excess material.Optimised staysFlatter stays create smoother air flow compared with round or oval tubes. The deep stays create greater stiffness, improving power transfer and acceleration.Ridable aeroA mix of high quality carbon fibre expertly sourced ensures the frame is stiff, lightweight and compliant. High modulus, ultra high modulus and uni directional carbon is bonded with nano resins. Learn more about Condor nano carbon technology.",
